                            <comment id="16660428" author="isapego" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 10:54:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tests pass: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F5043%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F5043%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

